    <briefdescription>
<para>Location of a PHI instruction that is also a debug-info variable value, for the duration of register allocation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loaded by the PHI-elimination pass, and emitted as DBG_PHI instructions during VirtRegRewriter, with maintenance applied by intermediate passes that edit registers (such as coalescing and the allocator passes). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
